WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.440
St. Louis has a lot of great businesses,
and plenty of them do what you do.

2
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:12.640
So when someone searches for what you do,
they're choosing between you and a lot of others.

3
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.280
They open a few websites, and they call
the one that looks like the best choice.

4
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:24.480
If your website looks dated, or nobody can find it,
that call goes to somebody across town.

5
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.840
River City Digital is a family-owned
web design studio, right here in St. Louis.

6
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.960
We design a custom website that makes
your business look like the obvious choice.

7
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:41.680
We build every page so customers can call you
with one tap, on any phone.

8
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:48.180
And we set it up so people can find you on Google,
and in AI tools like ChatGPT.

9
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:53.280
We know this city, from Wentzville to Clayton,
and from St. Charles to the Hill.

10
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:59.000
We've built websites for businesses like Mend Health
in Kirkwood, and The Wellness Collective.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.060
Want to see what your new website could look like first?

12
00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:07.720
Tell us about your business, and share your logo,
and we'll design a free mockup for you.

13
00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:13.960
There's no payment and no obligation, and
we agree on the price before we build anything.

14
00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:18.520
Tap the Request My Free Mockup button,
right here on this page.

15
00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:24.160
We're River City Digital, and we're right here in St. Louis.
Let's show you what your website could be.
